{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"bf3992de1241f0a2761c9efa58581cb6bd262938a2171a1c4830bff116299f2f","digest":{"component_or_area":"test_rebar_repo_isolation","key_entities":["tests/interfaces/test_rebar_repo_isolation.py::test_copy_repoints_sibling_origin_and_keeps_refs_isolated","tests/interfaces/test_rebar_repo_isolation.py::test_fixture_bare_remote_leaves_no_detached_upkeep_behind_a_push","tests/_git_upkeep.py::apply_upkeep_pins","tests/_topology_template.py::_local_sibling_rewrites","_BARE_REMOTE_UPKEEP_PINS","receive.autogc","gc.autoDetach","maintenance.autoDetach","objects/maintenance.lock","git maintenance run --auto --quiet --detach","GIT_TRACE2_EVENT","shutil.copytree"],"problem_keywords":["flaky test","race condition","git auto-maintenance","detached background process","directory tree mutation during copy"],"propositions":["A bare git repository created with `git init --bare` and then immediately pushed into spawns detached background `git maintenance run` processes that outlive the push command, leaving the object database concurrently mutable during subsequent directory operations like copytree.","The flaky copytree failure occurs because git's post-push auto-maintenance repack process prunes loose-object fanout directories mid-walk, not merely because of the maintenance.lock file.","The test fixture bare remote must be pinned with receive.autogc=false, gc.autoDetach=false, and maintenance.autoDetach=false before any push to prevent detached background processes.","A new guard test asserts the absence of detached maintenance children by inspecting the GIT_TRACE2_EVENT trace, with a receive-pack positive control to ensure the trace captured the push event."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787540547429330001,"uuid":"2d2afc21-6da1-4a30-b800-bffd3b7efc15"}